    "content": {
      "content": "<html><head></head><body><a name=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111062\"></a><a name=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111062\"></a>  <h1>添加APP ID、修改包名、配置签名证书</h1> <div><p>为确保接入的第三方应用是合法的，华为会对应用的包名、APP ID及证书指纹进行校验。以确保和申请账号服务时提供的一致。</p> <p>在您调测验证前，请对应用完成如下修改。</p> <div class=\"section\" id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111062__section356518243314\"><a name=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111062__section356518243314\"></a><a name=\"section356518243314\"></a><h4>添加APP ID</h4><ol><li><span>打开<strong>AndroidManifest.xml</strong>文件。</span><p></p><div class=\"fignone\"><span class=\"figcap\"><b>图1 </b>打开AndroidManifest.xml文件</span><br><span><img originheight=\"193\" originwidth=\"354\" src=\"https://contentcenter-vali-drcn.dbankcdn.cn/pvt_2/DeveloperAlliance_scene_100_1/d1/v3/5fcfd73vTfqmrFFO9MfkTw/zh-cn_image_0000001873951270.png?HW-CC-KV=V1&amp;HW-CC-Date=20261113T044150Z&amp;HW-CC-Expire=31536000000&amp;HW-CC-Sign=14FB2E127DFCF4C3CEB964F2F002E14226C939A0C12520C1477095EBF043877E\"></span></div> <p></p></li><li><span>在“application”中添加开发者联盟创建应用时生成的<strong>APP ID</strong>信息。</span><p></p><div class=\"p\">value请使用<a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-Guides/registering-applying-account-0000001050818011\">申请账号服务</a>过程中创建产品生成的<strong>APP ID</strong>。<pre class=\"screen\">&lt;meta-data\n    android:name=\"com.huawei.hms.client.appid\"\n    android:value=\"******\"/&gt;\n&lt;!-- 将上述 * 号内容修改为实际 APP ID，其他内容无需修改  --&gt;</pre> </div> <div class=\"fignone\"><span class=\"figcap\"><b>图2 </b>添加APP ID</span><br><span><img originheight=\"98\" originwidth=\"468\" src=\"https://contentcenter-vali-drcn.dbankcdn.cn/pvt_2/DeveloperAlliance_scene_100_1/5/v3/Jm9I2HpZTa-3vKkyBdepRA/zh-cn_image_0000001874111146.png?HW-CC-KV=V1&amp;HW-CC-Date=20261113T044150Z&amp;HW-CC-Expire=31536000000&amp;HW-CC-Sign=097A627E0BA43C9CFB1D33221E83E656C112958CC162C18ADA7C9B784F1847D6\"></span></div> <p></p></li></ol> </div> <div class=\"section\" id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111062__section1482153012336\"><a name=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111062__section1482153012336\"></a><a name=\"section1482153012336\"></a><h4>修改包名</h4><p>如果您的包名与<a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-Guides/registering-applying-account-0000001050818011\">申请账号服务</a>中填写的包名不一致，请<a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/HMSCore-Guides/application-package-name-0000001580840241\" target=\"_blank\">修改应用包名</a>为一致。</p> </div> <div class=\"section\" id=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111062__section1041814153312\"><a name=\"ZH-CN_TOPIC_0000001874111062__section1041814153312\"></a><a name=\"section1041814153312\"></a><h4>配置签名证书</h4><ol><li><span>生成签名证书。开发者通过Android Studio创建一个新的签名文件并使用其对APK进行签名。此签名文件后续会用于生成SHA256指纹。</span><p></p><ol><li>在新建的Android Studio工程的菜单栏中选择\"Build &gt; Generate Signed Bundle/APK...\"。<p><span><img originheight=\"689\" originwidth=\"766\" src=\"https://contentcenter-vali-drcn.dbankcdn.cn/pvt_2/DeveloperAlliance_scene_100_1/19/v3/PvOJiiFcQ06_-uhy4v7LNQ/zh-cn_image_0000002752537741.png?HW-CC-KV=V1&amp;HW-CC-Date=20261113T044150Z&amp;HW-CC-Expire=31536000000&amp;HW-CC-Sign=FBB31D69D56F69B2415AEB851B2FC29C66B145F9DF4656358B7A4F7066B2BCCC\"></span></p> </li><li>在\"Generate Signed Bundle or APK\"页面，选择\"APK\"签名，并点击\"Next\"。<p><span><img originheight=\"482\" originwidth=\"626\" src=\"https://contentcenter-vali-drcn.dbankcdn.cn/pvt_2/DeveloperAlliance_scene_100_1/fb/v3/kevb_qxCTjS2s85jPGvKtQ/zh-cn_image_0000002752458815.png?HW-CC-KV=V1&amp;HW-CC-Date=20261113T044150Z&amp;HW-CC-Expire=31536000000&amp;HW-CC-Sign=7CA344010AC31DA54DB7FD42823FA5609BC6BDFD0873C59C00970FF3EE63AA7D\"></span></p> </li><li>在填写签名文件信息页面，如果已经存在签名文件，则点击\"Choose existing...\"选择签名文件，并填写对应签名文件的\"Key store password\"、\"Key alias\"、\"Key password\"，然后点击\"Next\"。<p><span><img originheight=\"481\" originwidth=\"625\" src=\"https://contentcenter-vali-drcn.dbankcdn.cn/pvt_2/DeveloperAlliance_scene_100_1/77/v3/Qe5hi2UTRoWgpimrrYgTHQ/zh-cn_image_0000002752459099.png?HW-CC-KV=V1&amp;HW-CC-Date=20261113T044150Z&amp;HW-CC-Expire=31536000000&amp;HW-CC-Sign=F3C9ED4A27576631BFDE2B3CDFFB3D43EA2581C231577A4B86CE3175664328FE\"></span></p> <p>如果不存在签名文件，则选择\"Create new...\"，创建一个新的签名文件。</p> <p><span><img originheight=\"481\" originwidth=\"624\" src=\"https://contentcenter-vali-drcn.dbankcdn.cn/pvt_2/DeveloperAlliance_scene_100_1/dc/v3/yh83hIG4TdWlqDaktVIcqw/zh-cn_image_0000002752540381.png?HW-CC-KV=V1&amp;HW-CC-Date=20261113T044150Z&amp;HW-CC-Expire=31536000000&amp;HW-CC-Sign=8926809652135989400556D806B94185FA4835596220C247BE8960F5DF295779\"></span></p> <p>在创建新的签名文件页面，填写签名文件的保存地址以及保存文件名称、签名文件的密码、Alias等信息。</p> <p><span><img originheight=\"650\" originwidth=\"660\" src=\"https://contentcenter-vali-drcn.dbankcdn.cn/pvt_2/DeveloperAlliance_scene_100_1/d9/v3/TqNA-OHqTcumi5rx1KeUlg/zh-cn_image_0000002752540547.png?HW-CC-KV=V1&amp;HW-CC-Date=20261113T044150Z&amp;HW-CC-Expire=31536000000&amp;HW-CC-Sign=EAAB58D46BCD43BC249C58F88AFD421B1C8638EEEFF455ADFD61DE03EC81A29E\"></span></p> <p>完成新签名文件创建后，在\"Generate Signed Bundle or APK\"弹出框页面上会显示对应签名文件的信息，然后点击\"Next\"。</p> <p><span><img originheight=\"481\" originwidth=\"626\" src=\"https://contentcenter-vali-drcn.dbankcdn.cn/pvt_2/DeveloperAlliance_scene_100_1/3d/v3/8R3r1iliQmKkMI_jcCAGQw/zh-cn_image_0000002722940780.png?HW-CC-KV=V1&amp;HW-CC-Date=20261113T044150Z&amp;HW-CC-Expire=31536000000&amp;HW-CC-Sign=1F1E15BB6980F5F28002421B7D284E900A42DA6D20983085511D8A514DB3B681\"></span></p> </li><li>在填写完签名信息页面点击\"Next\"后，出现选择签名方式页面，在此页面勾选\"V1\"和\"V2\"签名选项，并点击\"Finish\"，生成一个签名APK（此APK可上传至AppGallery Connect用于自动获取应用包名）。<p><span><img originheight=\"481\" originwidth=\"626\" src=\"https://contentcenter-vali-drcn.dbankcdn.cn/pvt_2/DeveloperAlliance_scene_100_1/b3/v3/F4ybzLmsSZa1_DKKP_Uv_w/zh-cn_image_0000002722780868.png?HW-CC-KV=V1&amp;HW-CC-Date=20261113T044150Z&amp;HW-CC-Expire=31536000000&amp;HW-CC-Sign=B0D324897D54D3C59561995EB37D415463EDBE79ABE52016E6F8D2111144B462\"></span></p> </li></ol> <p></p></li><li><span>生成签名证书指纹。开发者通过JDK的Keytool工具以及签名文件，导出SHA256指纹。</span><p></p><ol><li>使用JDK携带的Keytool工具导出签名证书中的SHA256信息。<ul><li>Windows系统<ol class=\"substepthirdol\"><li>执行CMD命令打开命令行工具，执行cd命令进入keytool.exe所在的目录（以下样例为JDK安装在C盘的Program Files目录）。</li><li>执行keytool -list -v -keystore &lt;keystore-file&gt;命令，其中&lt;keystore-file&gt;为应用签名证书的完整路径。</li><li>根据结果获取对应的SHA256指纹。<p>示例：</p> <pre class=\"screen\">cd C:\\Program Files\\Java\\jdk\\bin\nkeytool -list -v -keystore C:\\TestApp.jks</pre> <p><span><img originheight=\"388\" originwidth=\"924\" src=\"https://contentcenter-vali-drcn.dbankcdn.cn/pvt_2/DeveloperAlliance_scene_100_1/3e/v3/uA4wcl35TYWvxv0otqweyQ/zh-cn_image_0000002757568784.png?HW-CC-KV=V1&amp;HW-CC-Date=20261113T044150Z&amp;HW-CC-Expire=31536000000&amp;HW-CC-Sign=AE834A6EBD16D5CD050997A563DD972D54D740FA0A740D9445377CBA23E3BA2B\"></span></p> </li></ol> </li><li>macOS系统<ol class=\"substepthirdol\"><li>打开Terminal终端。</li><li>执行命令keytool -list -v -keystore &lt;keystore-file&gt;，其中&lt;keystore-file&gt;为应用签名证书的完整路径，</li><li>根据结果获取对应的SHA256指纹。</li></ol> <p>示例：</p> <pre class=\"screen\">keytool -list -v -keystore /Users/admin/Downloads/Demo.jks</pre> </li></ul> </li></ol> <p></p></li><li><span>AppGallery Connect上添加指纹证书。开发者将生成的SHA256指纹配置到AppGallery Connect上。</span><p></p><ol><li>登录<a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/service/josp/agc/index.html#/\" target=\"_blank\">AppGallery Connect</a>网站，点击\"开发与服务\"。</li><li>在项目列表中找到您的项目，在项目中点击需要配置签名证书指纹的应用。</li><li>在\"项目设置 &gt; 常规\"页面的\"应用\"区域，点击\"SHA256证书指纹\"后的\"添加证书指纹\"，输入生成的SHA256指纹。<p><span><img originheight=\"452\" originwidth=\"929\" src=\"https://contentcenter-vali-drcn.dbankcdn.cn/pvt_2/DeveloperAlliance_scene_100_1/7e/v3/0xoptsM_QJKO8ZRkH6E1oA/zh-cn_image_0000002752471471.png?HW-CC-KV=V1&amp;HW-CC-Date=20261113T044150Z&amp;HW-CC-Expire=31536000000&amp;HW-CC-Sign=7824D9BC53D5301D3576E882D38483B0A0EFD8341C8818279934011228C14C9D\"></span></p> </li><li>配置完成后，点击\"保存\"。</li></ol> <p></p></li><li><span>AppGallery Connect上开通API服务。</span><p></p><ol><li>在项目的\"应用\"信息页面，选择\"API管理\"页签。</li><li>在\"API管理\"页签中，找到想要开通的服务，打开该服务所在行的开关。<p><span><img originheight=\"670\" originwidth=\"1044\" src=\"https://contentcenter-vali-drcn.dbankcdn.cn/pvt_2/DeveloperAlliance_scene_100_1/6a/v3/DmsePUBRTeyg5cYG1PqwwQ/zh-cn_image_0000002752551931.png?HW-CC-KV=V1&amp;HW-CC-Date=20261113T044150Z&amp;HW-CC-Expire=31536000000&amp;HW-CC-Sign=782F489104FB18026DCDEB41A0FD6BC0C8BF037E3AA6DC49DA9F1169DBA57CE6\"></span></p> </li></ol> <p></p></li><li><span>添加应用的AppGallery Connect配置文件。</span><p></p><p>登录<a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/service/josp/agc/index.html\" target=\"_blank\">AppGallery Connect</a>网站，在“项目设置 &gt; 常规”页面的“应用”区域，点击“agconnect-services.json”下载配置文件。</p> <p><span><img originheight=\"156\" originwidth=\"879\" src=\"https://contentcenter-vali-drcn.dbankcdn.cn/pvt_2/DeveloperAlliance_scene_100_1/05/v3/ZbXv_mIBSgidBtzjTPEA2A/zh-cn_image_0000002757730642.png?HW-CC-KV=V1&amp;HW-CC-Date=20261113T044150Z&amp;HW-CC-Expire=31536000000&amp;HW-CC-Sign=065DC5137F15DA0239F3833063FCBF894F0842331249674587205A0E2EEC067C\"></span></p> <p>将“agconnect-services.json”文件拷贝到应用级根目录下。</p> <p><span><img originheight=\"383\" originwidth=\"246\" src=\"https://contentcenter-vali-drcn.dbankcdn.cn/pvt_2/DeveloperAlliance_scene_100_1/fc/v3/rTJMbzITSyirV7RyNwlhiA/zh-cn_image_0000002787129431.png?HW-CC-KV=V1&amp;HW-CC-Date=20261113T044150Z&amp;HW-CC-Expire=31536000000&amp;HW-CC-Sign=BAC24E0878D3B037481DB4EF0F6CA91967BDC462C109A882131BA70F364296BA\"></span></p> <p></p></li><li><span>配置HMS Core SDK的Maven仓地址。</span><p></p><p>具体请参考<a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/HMSCore-Guides/integrating-sdk-0000001050069724\" target=\"_blank\">配置HMS Core SDK的Maven仓地址</a>。</p> <p></p></li><li><span>添加agcp插件配置。</span><p></p><p>打开应用级的“build.gradle”文件（通常是 app/build.gradle），添加agcp插件配置，有如下两种方式，请根据实际情况选择：</p> <p><span><img originheight=\"360\" originwidth=\"233\" src=\"https://contentcenter-vali-drcn.dbankcdn.cn/pvt_2/DeveloperAlliance_scene_100_1/8f/v3/PXRAR9SUTHWmYzayQf-nKA/zh-cn_image_0000002723144934.png?HW-CC-KV=V1&amp;HW-CC-Date=20261113T044150Z&amp;HW-CC-Expire=31536000000&amp;HW-CC-Sign=94A6B8F349DDF12F496E814CA00A2D4D45AE8253D97F415EDC612CE000AE6845\"></span></p> <ul><li>方式一：在文件头部声明下一行添加如下配置。<pre class=\"screen\">apply plugin: 'com.huawei.agconnect'</pre> </li><li>方式二：在plugins中添加如下配置。<pre class=\"screen\">plugins { \n    id 'com.android.application' \n    // 添加如下配置 \n    id 'com.huawei.agconnect' \n}</pre> </li></ul> <p></p></li><li><span>配置项目签名。</span><p></p><ol><li>将已经生成的签名文件HmsDemo.jks拷贝到app文件夹下，并打开应用级build.gradle文件（通常是 app/build.gradle）。<p><span><img originheight=\"530\" originwidth=\"411\" src=\"https://contentcenter-vali-drcn.dbankcdn.cn/pvt_2/DeveloperAlliance_scene_100_1/91/v3/8mIwqNH8QrKoPYFYHQcQhQ/zh-cn_image_0000002722985606.png?HW-CC-KV=V1&amp;HW-CC-Date=20261113T044150Z&amp;HW-CC-Expire=31536000000&amp;HW-CC-Sign=8E14D502E7CDC1639D06E3FF5A9034CD6204C80E1C5E60E7D6ADF42FF90B57A2\"></span></p> </li><li>在build.gradle文件的android闭包中添加签名配置信息。<pre class=\"screen\">signingConfigs { \n     release { \n         storeFile file('HmsDemo.jks') \n         keyAlias 'hmsdemo' \n         keyPassword '123456' \n         storePassword '123456' \n         v1SigningEnabled true \n         v2SigningEnabled true \n     } \n} \n\nbuildTypes { \n     release { \n         signingConfig signingConfigs.release \n         minifyEnabled false \n         proguardFiles getDefaultProguardFile('proguard-android-optimize.txt'), 'proguard-rules.pro' \n     } \n     debug { \n         signingConfig signingConfigs.release \n         debuggable true \n     } \n}</pre> </li></ol> <p></p></li><li><span>点击\"Sync Now\"同步工程。completed successfully即代表同步成功，至此完成了集成准备工作。</span><p></p><p><span><img originheight=\"214\" originwidth=\"580\" src=\"https://contentcenter-vali-drcn.dbankcdn.cn/pvt_2/DeveloperAlliance_scene_100_1/4/v3/1gTN6Xn1RHGAnqwBkClrdw/zh-cn_image_0000002752585633.png?HW-CC-KV=V1&amp;HW-CC-Date=20261113T044150Z&amp;HW-CC-Expire=31536000000&amp;HW-CC-Sign=0F8CB2E6D7B23E3296F70AD63B4D7B7636F73DF08605D6F57340DD22F5DE23B4\"></span></p> <p></p></li></ol> <p></p> <p><a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/codelab/HMSPreparation/index.html#7\" target=\"_blank\">配置签名证书</a>，注意签名文件需与<a href=\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/connectivity-Guides/registering-applying-account-0000001050818011\">申请账号服务</a>中填写的证书指纹匹配。</p> <div class=\"note\"><img originheight=\"38\" originwidth=\"102\" src=\"https://contentcenter-vali-drcn.dbankcdn.cn/pvt_2/DeveloperAlliance_scene_100_1/16/v3/I85RUEBnTGOVIw4-9EQkzA/note_3.0-zh-cn.png?HW-CC-KV=V1&amp;HW-CC-Date=20261113T044150Z&amp;HW-CC-Expire=31536000000&amp;HW-CC-Sign=A27B7BCB72E8C88F8D5A1FC45B8A695BD63D1ECA657C0D8DCA917054BA59B27C\"><span class=\"notetitle\"> </span><div class=\"notebody\"><p>构建应用时，请注意构建包含签名信息的应用。如图所示。</p> </div></div> <div class=\"fignone\"><span class=\"figcap\"><b>图3 </b>构建包含签名的应用</span><br><span><img originheight=\"333\" originwidth=\"256\" src=\"https://contentcenter-vali-drcn.dbankcdn.cn/pvt_2/DeveloperAlliance_scene_100_1/5a/v3/Q-MkqxcCQOeu4cg_KAnTow/zh-cn_image_0000001920110305.png?HW-CC-KV=V1&amp;HW-CC-Date=20261113T044150Z&amp;HW-CC-Expire=31536000000&amp;HW-CC-Sign=E868DED3152C68EF6E96154300AA9E14D019606B6356B45E4C656B3BA5EA0579\"></span></div> </div> </div> <div></div></body></html>",
